# LocReach: local fix → online deploy (PERMANENT)

**Permanent rule — never skip.**

For any platform bug, comment, update, or fix request on LocReach:

1. Implement and verify **locally** first (`localization-leads` / related config).
2. At the **end of every session** that produced LocReach changes: commit (when there is work) and **push to GitHub** (`meetnama/LocReach`) so Render auto-deploys to https://locreach.onrender.com.
3. Do not leave fixes only on the local machine.
4. If the change involves SearXNG or OpenSERP Docker/config, push those too so the matching Render services update.
5. End-of-session commit+push is standing permission for LocReach work (never commit secrets/`.env`).
